## Schema

### Required

- `name` (String) Profile name. Must be unique.

### Optional

- `description` (String) Profile description. Omit to leave an existing description unchanged.
- `ignore_warnings` (Boolean) Suppress warnings about the estimated snapshot count. Omit to leave the current value unchanged. An omitted value is not sent as false.
- `period` (Block List) When the profile takes a snapshot. name is unique in the profile. hour and minute are the time of day. retention is required, is a number of seconds, and has no default. A period left out of the configuration is deleted. Changing name replaces that period. (see [below for nested schema](#nestedblock--period))

### Read-Only

- `id` (String) Snapshot profile key assigned by VergeOS. vergeio_vm.snapshot_profile uses this key as a number: tonumber(vergeio_snapshot_profile.example.id).

<a id="nestedblock--period"></a>
### Nested Schema for `period`

Required:

- `frequency` (String) How often the snapshot runs: custom, hourly, daily, weekly, monthly, or yearly.
- `name` (String) Period name. Must be unique within the profile. Changing it replaces the period.
- `retention` (Number) How long to keep each snapshot, in seconds. Required. There is no default. VergeOS expires the snapshot after this many seconds. A missing retention is not keep-forever; clients that omit it have stored a 24 hour expiry. Zero is rejected.

Optional:

- `day_of_month` (Number) Day of the month, 1 through 31. 0 means any day. Omit to leave the current value unchanged.
- `day_of_week` (String) Day of the week for a weekly period: sun, mon, tue, wed, thu, fri, sat, or any. Omit to leave the current value unchanged.
- `hour` (Number) Hour of day, 0 through 23. With minute, this is the time of day. Omit to leave the current value unchanged. An omitted value is not sent.
- `immutable` (Boolean) Lock the snapshot until it is unlocked. Applies to system snapshots. Omit to leave the current value unchanged. An omitted value is not sent.
- `max_tier` (String) Highest storage tier that may hold the snapshot, from 1 (no restriction) through 5. Omit to leave the current value unchanged.
- `min_snapshots` (Number) Minimum number of snapshots to retain, including during an outage longer than retention. Omit to leave the current value unchanged. An omitted value is not sent.
- `minute` (Number) Minute of the hour, 0 through 59. Omit to leave the current value unchanged. An omitted value is not sent. Set 0 explicitly for the top of the hour.
- `month` (Number) Month of the year, 1 through 12. 0 means any month. Omit to leave the current value unchanged.
- `quiesce` (Boolean) Quiesce the guest while the snapshot is taken. Requires a guest agent. Applies to VMs and volumes. Omit to leave the current value unchanged. An omitted value is not sent as false.

Read-Only:

- `key` (String) Period key assigned by VergeOS.

## Import

Import is supported using the profile key.

```shell
terraform import vergeio_snapshot_profile.example <id>
```
